	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De foedere nihil adhuc conclusum, nondum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>audita sunt suffragia et vota communitatum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>exterarum omnia; pleręque videntur et merito <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>a<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>bhorrere ab illo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Faxit dominus, ut melior adhuc pars <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vincat, quamvis ego iam pridem de hac re desperaverim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Caeterum quę tibi <persName ref="p8416">Abrahamus Musculus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>scribit, rogo, ut tibi sint cordi et tuo nos iuves consilio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName> rijßt uns ein fulen poßen, dabi man inn aber <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>syn muß lehren kennen, understat <foreign xml:lang="la">post abitum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> pię memorię</foreign> sin letste doctrinam, so <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>am klärsten ist, underztrucken und zcorrumpieren <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>und sin sultzbrügen hinyn zuͦ flicken on wüßen <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>und willen Abrahami und unser aller, das <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>wir nur von imm verguͦt hand; werdend deßhalb <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>umb das exemplar wider luͦgen und es eh anderschwo <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dann also corrumpiert laßen trucken, wiewol <persName ref="p5213">Hervagii</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>vidua schon ettlichs gält daruff geben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Es sind <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sine alten künst</foreign> se simulare amicum veritatis et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>per cuniculos eam supprimere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Gott vergelte ims.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Alias nihil habeo, nisi quod ulcere malo la<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>boro, quod tamen aliqui mihi pro sanitate in<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>terpretantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Amici et fratres te omnes sa<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>lutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Salvi sint et tui omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 28. ianuarii 15<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>65.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Ioa<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nnes Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et compatri suo mo<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>dis omnibus colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
